---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title={"Metabolic Intelligence: Budget-Native Compute from Tag to Campus"}
  description={"About: Metabolic Intelligence: Budget-Native Compute from Tag to Campus. Metabolic Intelligence (MEI) is a class of computer intelligence designed to run inside a fixed energy budget."}
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">Product white paper · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      Metabolic Intelligence: Budget-Native Compute from Tag to Campus
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      Metabolic Intelligence (MEI) is a class of computer intelligence designed to run inside a fixed energy budget. This paper defines the class, reports emulator and datasheet results on a sensor tag, and reports a protocol-level test of a grid-following data center, each labeled by evidence class.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray mb-3">In plain words</p>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        <li>Give a computer a fixed energy budget, and design it to give the best answer it can inside that budget.</li>
        <li>A tiny sensor tag that checks food freshness can then run for about eight years on a coin battery.</li>
        <li>A data center can cut its power use when the electricity grid asks, by pausing or shrinking work, without giving wrong answers.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/products/mei/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-dark bg-brand-amber px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-gold transition-colors">
        Read → /products/mei/
      </a>
      <a href="/pdfs/mei.pdf" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-amber border border-brand-amber/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-amber/10 transition-colors" download>
        Download PDF
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate border border-brand-border px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:text-brand-white transition-colors">
        ← Catalog
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
